      "ts": 1785782714.4428327,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\ud83d\udea8 OFFICIAL: Mavericks sign Naji Marshall to a contract extension.",
      "cat": "Official",
      "ts": 1785701473.7260737,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "LeBron to Philadelphia doesn't make them contenders. Star power doesn't matter if you can't stay healthy and your roster can't shoot. The Celtics are still the East's favorite.",
      "cat": "Opinion",
      "ts": 1785621627.3214602,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 REPORT: Jeremy Sochan agrees to one-year deal with the Portland Trail Blazers, per ESPN.",
