      "ts": 1785616586.9456096,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\ud83d\udea8 REPORT: Gary Payton II re-signing with the Warriors, per @TheSteinLine. Deal on course to be finalized this weekend.",
      "cat": "Report",
      "ts": 1785614538.0687294,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 REPORT: Dwane Casey has turned down a head coaching job with BC Roma SPQR and will remain with the Pistons as an adviser, per Marc Stein.",
      "cat": "Report",
      "ts": 1785568687.9284964,
      "media": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Kevin Durant vetoing a Warriors trade to avoid reuniting with Steph Curry tells you everything about how that relationship ended. Two guys who won together can't even be in the same locker room now. That's not a rivalry issue\u2014that's real beef.",
      "cat": "Opinion",
      "ts": 1785535241.5301273,
